          We believe successful industries are built on strong governance,
          technology, operational excellence and strategic partnerships.
          Through shared expertise and disciplined execution, we enable
          each subsidiary to scale sustainably while creating long-term
          value for <span class="whitespace-nowrap">stakeholders.</span>
        </p>
        <ol class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            <span class="shrink-0 font-medium text-accent">01</span>
            <span>Strong governance across every business in the Group</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            <span class="shrink-0 font-medium text-accent">02</span>
            <span>Technology-driven operations and operational excellence</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            <span class="shrink-0 font-medium text-accent">03</span>
            <span>Strategic partnerships that unlock scale</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            <span class="shrink-0 font-medium text-accent">04</span>
            <span>Long-term value creation for all stakeholders</span>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
