            </svg>
            <span>SandCorp</span>
          </div>
          <p class="max-w-[620px] text-[18px] leading-[1.667]">
            A real estate development company delivering innovative
            residential, commercial and mixed-use developments across
            Kenya, backed by a live pipeline of
            <span class="whitespace-nowrap">active projects.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="py-10 last:pb-0">
